# Boxes compare by what they hold, so the search built-ins and match
# work on nested arrays (Box a is Eq when a is).
== SOURCE
("ab" "cd") m_atch "ab" "cd"
("ab" "cd") m_atch "ab" "ce"
("ab" "cd") = "ab" "ce"
t_ally u_nique "ab" "cd" "ab"
("ab" "cd" "ef") i_ndexOf "ef" "ab" "zz"
("ab" "cd") m_atch (e_nclose "ab") c_at e_nclose "cd"
== RESULT
1
0
1 0
2
3 1 4
1
